# Ingot preset policy (systemd.preset(5)).
#
# On first boot, systemd applies the preset policy to all vendor units
# (systemd[1] journal: "Applying preset policy"). The built-in
# catch-all (99-default-disable.preset: "disable *") disables every unit
# not explicitly listed, so enablement symlinks of Ingot's own units are
# removed on the first boot unless listed here. This file sorts before
# the catch-all; the first matching preset line wins.
enable ingot-harness-probe.service
